# avito-scraper — configuration
# =============================
# Copy to `.env` and fill in. `.env` is gitignored; this file is NOT, so it
# must never hold a real value. env_config.py reads exactly the four names
# below and warns about anything else, which catches a typo like
# TWO_CAPTCHA_KEY before it becomes a confusing empty run.
#
# Credentials live HERE and nowhere else — never on a command line. `ps` reads
# argv, and argv lands in shell history and in CI logs.

# 2captcha.com API key. Used to solve avito.ru's firewall captcha (GeeTest v4)
# and by tools/browser_profile_client.py. Measured 2026-10-06: $0.00299 per
# solve; a fresh browser session meets the captcha wall often enough that a
# run without a key usually ends blocked (exit 3).
TWOCAPTCHA_KEY=

# A Russian residential proxy, as one URL: http://user:pass@host:port
# A 2Captcha gateway login selects the region and pins the exit:
#
#   http://{login}-zone-custom-region-RU-session-{id}-sessTime-120:{password}@eu.proxy.rucaptcha.com:2334
#
# What it is used for depends on the transport:
#   * local browser (no AVITO_CDP_ENDPOINT): the browser's exit. A login
#     without `-session-` is pinned to one session per run automatically.
#   * with AVITO_CDP_ENDPOINT: NOT the browser's exit — the remote browser
#     brings its own. It must be the exact session the endpoint was built
#     with, because the captcha solver has to use the browser's IP: a token
#     solved from another exit was rejected (measured).
#     `tools/browser_profile_client.py connection --mint-session --write-env`
#     writes both values together.
AVITO_PROXY=

# A Scraping Browser API CDP endpoint (Playwright and pyppeteer engines;
# Selenium cannot use one). Built by the API — do not assemble it by hand:
#
#   python3 tools/browser_profile_client.py accounts
#   python3 tools/browser_profile_client.py connection --account-id N --mint-session --write-env
#
# Its shape is ws://{login}-zone-scraping_browser-…:{password}@cb.2captcha.com:9222
# A profile allows ONE live connection; a session whose -sessTime- expired
# answers `500 proxy_error` on connect — rebuild with the command above.
AVITO_CDP_ENDPOINT=

# Optional. The --url to use when none is given.
AVITO_URL=
